  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>What you send us on WhatsApp.</b> If you use the early-access form, your answers (optional name, attempt, medium, stage, phone type) are placed into a WhatsApp message that you choose to send. We receive that message and your phone number, as with any WhatsApp chat.</li>
