    <li><b>Visit statistics (only if switched on).</b> We may use Umami, a privacy-friendly analytics tool that does not use cookies. It records page views and which buttons are tapped, not who you are.</li>
    <li><b>On your device.</b> This site remembers your language and light or dark choice in your browser. It is not sent to us.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The attempts and age calculator runs in your browser. What you type into it is not sent anywhere.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>To reply to you, to place you in a pod batch, to tell you about early access and offers you asked about, and to understand which parts of the site help people.</p>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not sell your data.</li>
    <li>We do not run advertising trackers on this site.</li>
    <li>This service is for people aged 18 and over.</li>
